# Local test artefacts that live in the repo root while a box is being tried
# out: the box's admin UI password, the Tailscale OAuth client secret (which
# does not expire, unlike an auth key) and a downloaded base image. One
# `git add -A` is all it would take, and the ISO alone is 4 GB.
/admin-webui
/tailscale-key
/*.iso
# Same things once they are collected in one place — an ssh private key, the
# box password and the OAuth secret. Anchored entries above do not cover a
# subdirectory, which is exactly how they escaped the first time.
/bootstrap/

# The German setup runbook and its step screenshots are for internal company
# use, not the public repo. README screenshots live under docs/screenshots/.
/docs/EINRICHTUNG.md
/docs/img/
